  "details": "Part of this necessitates other age-verification systems in VRChat, but with the recent announcement this is clearly important. At the same time, some worlds may have a lot of featured that don't need to be locked behind a player not entering the world entirely. I feel like it would be ideal if we could check a player as being 18+ or not to block younger users from accessing certain content of a world, without blocking them entirely. A single boolean checking the user as being over 18 would give us this ability.",
